{"content":"0.5's gate: `cargo fmt --all --check`, clippy for `kcode-app-core`/`kcode-base`/`kcode-config-types`/`kcode-protocol`/`kcode-tui` and the provider runtimes with `--all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings`, and the full suite via `scripts/test.sh full`, because the resolution order and the spawn inheritance are behavior, not deletion (re-run any flake single-threaded before believing it). Then the live probe on its own socket: a fresh session on a `low`-capable model reports `low`, `/effort high` reports `high` and survives a resume, a worker spawned from it inherits `high`, and a config that still carries `provider.openai_reasoning_effort` or `agents.swarm_effort` starts clean and sets nothing.","status":"pending","priority":"","id":"t5","kind":"verify","assigned_to":"session_nautilus_1790962815996_8fa88cc17ddc5734"}
